%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H8_5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: My eyes need a moment to adjust to the light. When I open them, I see a
      green field around me, nothing but some trees and distant hills in sight.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is this place? I've never seen something like this.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I sit up and try to regain my composure. Finally, I spot a familiar brown
      muzzle sticking out of the grass next to me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 8
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I scoot over to him. His eyes are shut, I can see him breathing deeply
      in and out.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I don't think he'd like me to touch him\u2026 How can I wake him up?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try leaning closer, hovering over his face to check both of his eyes.
      I sense the feeling of his nostrils pushing out warm air on my skin. It is
      unfamiliar, but not uncomfortable.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wakey wakey?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: To my surprise, Mr. Horse's eyes actually flutter open. It takes him a
      second to fully regain his consciousness.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "{playerName}? Wh\u2014 what are you doing?"
    alternativeText: "Wh\u2014 what are you doing?"
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 7
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I notice I'm still hunched over his face and staring at him, so I quickly
      back up and give Mr. Horse some distance.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Oh sorry, I was just trying to wake you up. I don't know what happened.
      I must've passed out and\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Am I dreaming? Or hallucinating?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse gets up carefully and looks around. He seems to be quite energetic
      considering he was sleeping peacefully just seconds ago.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wow, how beautiful! I have not seen fields like these for a long time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 7
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This can't be real, right? I mean, it is quite pretty. Still, it feels
      like we just landed in some imaginary place.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try getting up too. My head is still buzzing, so I take my time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse? What happened?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He turns to me, his eyes beaming with joy.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I do not know, but I do feel great.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Well, I don't.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It is a riddle to me how we ended up in this place, however.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Do you think we're imagining things?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, this feels real. I certainly do hope it is. Let us explore. we must
      somehow find a way to explain our appearance in this place.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I really don't feel like going on a hike right now, but I guess we can't
      just stay here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Alright, but let's take it slow, okay? I'm still pretty shaken up by all
      that has happened.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse is already eagerly making his way through the grass. I can't
      help but imagine a wild horse galloping in a meadow when looking at him. He
      looks quite endearing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Did he even hear what I said? Anyways, I should start walking.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try to keep up with his quick pace even though I feel a bit weak. Looking
      around a bit more, I still don't quite know what to make of this place.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It all looks very warm and saturated. But still, I sense a certain coldness
      inside of me, which even the bright sun shining down on us can't seem to cure.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Where are we even going right now?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hey, Mr. Horse, can you slow down a bit please? I don't really have a good
      feeling about all of this.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse slows his steps and turns around to face me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What do you mean?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Are you not scared by us just randomly being teleported somewhere else?
      Don't you think something feels a bit different here?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I do. It is quite different indeed. The air feels light against the skin,
      every breath is refreshing. A sense of freedom is present throughout.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Why does he like it here so much? I guess it kinda is the natural habitat
      of a horse. But still, he is acting a bit unusual.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't feel the same way. I have this lingering sense of uneasiness around
      me. Something isn't right. I can't quite put my finger on it.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse still seems relaxed. He is looking at me, listening to what I
      have to say. I don't know if he fully understands what I am trying to convey
      though.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It is okay, I know you have been a bit disturbed by everything. The earthquake,
      meeting your first hybrid, and this peculiar occurrence just now. I do not
      think it is necessary to worry that much just yet. Let us continue and see
      where it leads us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It's not like I have a choice here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Come on, I do not mind you walking at your own pace either, just keep on
      going and surely, we will come across some help in no time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He continues his stride energetically, but a bit slower than previously.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Maybe he's right. I should stay calm, freaking out about a beautifully
      lush environment for no reason isn't helping anyone here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take a deep breath and follow him through the tall grass, letting the
      unfamiliar warmth and the sound of our footsteps sink in.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 41de7d8911b06044eb1ffbfc63d6d72a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e0d62c29450843ff8b3aeb0bd8627233, type: 2}
